Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:49.02,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:52.07,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:58.94,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:03.45,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:08.96,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:13.67,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.67,0:21:18.50,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:23.88,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:28.73,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:34.21,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:39.15,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:44.60,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:49.67,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:54.88,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:09.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:12.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:19.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Don't disappear on me all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:21.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:22.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.63,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, get a green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:41.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:49.11,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous if we don't hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:53.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.30,Main Dialog,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I want blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:46.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember this many families being here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:49.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:55.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:59.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... All right. Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:02.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Any idea what size you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:03.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:13.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was it like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:16.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do I do this..?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Stop flapping your arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:21.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:26.10,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pajamas! Underwear! Shirts! Socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need a skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:37.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All you've got are pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:41.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Skirts aren't allowed at the Kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kindergarten?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I completely forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's Monday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:01.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there, so just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:09.10,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:12.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be home in a minute, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:13.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.90,Main Dialog,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}You useless bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:24.28,Main Dialog,Man's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}You make everything hard on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:25.99,Main Dialog,Man's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}I'm gonna lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:28.20,Main Dialog,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:31.66,Main Dialog,Man's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.91,Main Dialog,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:36.00,Main Dialog,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6\i1}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.60,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:40.34,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is the Maeda residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:45.05,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Please accept my condolences for your sudden loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:47.55,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:51.20,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, it's Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, okay. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I didn't know your cell number.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:00.94,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:04.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you register for kindergarten?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.53,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Kindergarten..?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.29,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You really took Rin home?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.29,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.67,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "for now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:22.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So anyway, I can't take off work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What do I need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:27.63,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Look, they don't accept kids instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:29.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do something on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.14,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.47,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'd check with the city office...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:36.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But it's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:40.36,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, it's just Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:40.69,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, is that Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.15,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.48,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:44.74,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.74,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:47.90,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there's are temporary kindergartens...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:50.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A temporary kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.32,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:52.28,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.20,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? Dai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:56.79,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Rin! Rin! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nevermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:59.25,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm almost done, so just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.50,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I hate waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:03.13,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, I'm taking the miso soup off the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:04.55,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:08.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... It sounds busy over there, so I'll just call la-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:09.22,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:16.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Man, there aren't that many...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:19.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This'll double my commute...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:24.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:28.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This one's pretty close, but I can't get off by six...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:32.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Bye-bye, Reina. Talk to you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This looks like a good one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:40.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but they'll accept kids for only 10 days...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want a bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:06.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:09.19,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:13.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:26.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why is the futon warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:30.05,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:33.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:41.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, about the kindergarten we're going to today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:51.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food I'm about to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:51.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:56.20,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're not supposed to eat with your elbow on the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:09.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, the kindergarten you're going to today is only a temporary deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:10.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Only until we can find you an actual kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's "actual"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It means "for real"...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Leave my hair alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,F-Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:00.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:10.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Would you be embarrassed if other kids saw me carry you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:21.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:24.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, please take good care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:35.09,Main Dialog,Nursery Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. We'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:59.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:02.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to make it back while it's still light out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll come as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:15.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If I lie, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:18.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll swallow 1000 needles...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:19.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My finger was cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:24.72,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how the song goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, see ya! Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:39.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't consider your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:48.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What happened with your mother or Grandpa wasn't your fault,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:51.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but you're still left all alone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think I was going to leave you behind too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:00.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never let that happen to you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:14.27,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Read it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:17.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.59,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi. Wanna get some lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:42.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I brought some.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:44.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I need to leave a little early today...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:47.89,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah? I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:50.68,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Working really hard from the get-go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:54.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Take a photo of this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:09.99,Main Dialog,Woman Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:13.87,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi! You've got a call on line #4 about the private viewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:30.97,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:32.60,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:34.10,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.81,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:38.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.28,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:50.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:56.70,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.25,Main Dialog,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that. Go and change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:00.38,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:08.18,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, don't break it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:09.01,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.43,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.35,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:28.16,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.24,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.54,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata from Mitsutomo Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:36.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:40.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:55.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Kawachi here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:57.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:00.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:03.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'll be able to leave work in a few more minutes, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:05.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:50.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The kindergarten is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:04.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.68,Main Dialog,Nursery Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:15.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:27.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are those potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:31.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's burdock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:44.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I swallowed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,1000 needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.79,Main Dialog,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi! I need your signature!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:02.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I probably don't need to worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but what'll happen if I get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:16.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:18.55,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:27.15,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, this is what you sent out yesterday, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:34.15,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's unusual for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:38.41,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I already apologized to the recipient, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry... I give them al call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:47.29,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,We haven't gone out drinking for a while. How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:49.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, tonight's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.21,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Then, how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something tomorrow, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:59.68,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I get it! Good for you, you sly dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:22.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:41.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:19:01.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Run away from the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's no end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:44.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How long can I keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:56.50,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,These are Rin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.84,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,This is all she has,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:01.51,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,but her maternal handbook and other important documents are in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:05.01,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's only for a short period of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:08.43,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,raising a child is a very difficult thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:11.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's Rin who has it most difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:16.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just gonna take a peek...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:23.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's got the same mouth...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:31.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The family talks about you like you're some foul villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:34.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:35.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.35,0:22:21.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you sleeping over there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:31.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?! Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:36.00,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:45.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure... It's sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sweat...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:49.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Help me take the sheet off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:51.39,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I said it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:53.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying it's sweat too, aren't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
